### `crypto.createCipheriv(algorithm, key, iv[, options])`

<!-- YAML
added: v0.1.94
changes:
  - version:
    - v17.9.0
    - v16.17.0
    pr-url: https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/42427
    description: The `authTagLength` option is now optional when using the
