* `key` {Object|string|ArrayBuffer|Buffer|TypedArray|DataView}
  * `key`: {string|ArrayBuffer|Buffer|TypedArray|DataView|Object} The key
    material, either in PEM, DER, or JWK format.
  * `format`: {string} Must be `'pem'`, `'der'`, or `'jwk'`.
